{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 33, :comments ["<b>And I will scatter you</b> — the bent zayin to tell you that I gave you the land of the seven nations to uphold the Torah, whose pillars He hewed out as seven. And you harbored seven abominations in your hearts — therefore \"I will scatter you.\"" "<b>And I will make desolate</b> — two times in the Masorah: here and the other: והריקותי לכם ברכה עד בלי די (\"I will empty out for you blessing until there is no end\"). And you did not wish to uphold My commandments — therefore והריקותם אחריכם חרב (\"you emptied out after you the sword\")."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:48.945247292Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}